{
  "id": "ns-despacho-02",
  "name": "NetSentinel 02 - Despacho de alertas",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Despacho de alertas (cada 5 min)\n1. Cada 5 minutos (o cuando el flujo 01 lo invoca) se llama a **GET /alerts/pending-dispatch**: alertas por webhook o correo aún no entregadas.\n2. Por cada alerta se consulta su regla (`/alert-rules/{id}`) para conocer la URL del webhook o el destinatario.\n3. **Por canal**: *webhook* → HTTP Request a la URL de la regla (sin enviar la API key a terceros); *email* → nodo Send Email.\n4. Si el envío fue exitoso, **POST /alerts/{id}/delivered** marca la alerta como entregada. Si falla, queda pendiente y se reintenta en 5 min.\n\n**Correo:** el nodo Send Email viene DESHABILITADO. Para usarlo: cree la credencial SMTP en n8n, habilite el nodo y ponga `NETSENTINEL_SMTP_ENABLED=true` en `.env` (mientras tanto las alertas de correo quedan pendientes, no se marcan como entregadas).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 700,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "f80a2094-bf03-5fd2-bfa9-610da6bc38af",
      "name": "Nota flujo 02",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -250
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "21de3e2c-e67d-5f19-89de-79795d5d7348",
      "name": "Cada 5 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "b37eb7de-b707-5858-817d-dcb64cfe8364",
      "name": "Desde flujo 01",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.NETSENTINEL_API_URL }}/alerts/pending-dispatch",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.N8N_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "ca61074a-5d6e-558f-a131-3d6c14ca7e32",
      "name": "Alertas pendientes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        260,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.NETSENTINEL_API_URL }}/alert-rules/{{ $json.rule_id }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-API-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.N8N_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "d16560dc-05cd-5984-89c0-33988311d934",
      "name": "Obtener regla",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        500,
        280
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "// Une la alerta con su regla (destino del webhook / correo) y prepara el payload.\nconst alerta = $('Alertas pendientes').item.json;\nlet regla = $input.item.json || {};\nif (Array.isArray(regla) || regla.error) regla = {};        // regla no disponible: se usa lo que traiga la alerta\nconst webhook_url = alerta.webhook_url || regla.webhook_url || null;\nconst email_to = alerta.email_to || regla.email_to || null;\nlet channel = alerta.channel;\nif (channel === 'webhook' && !webhook_url) channel = 'sin_destino';\nif (channel === 'email' && !email_to) channel = 'sin_destino';\nreturn { json: {\n  alert_id: alerta.id, channel, severity: alerta.severity, title: alerta.title,\n  message: alerta.message, finding_id: alerta.finding_id, rule_id: alerta.rule_id,\n  webhook_url, email_to,\n  payload: { source: 'netsentinel', alert_id: alerta.id, finding_id: alerta.finding_id,\n             severity: alerta.severity, title: alerta.title, message: alerta.message,\n             created_at: alerta.created_at },\n} };\n"
      },
      "id": "04bafbb5-9e38-5354-83bc-a3941f5b4c57",
      "name": "Resolver destino",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        740,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "08f442c3-d323-5434-8493-19b8049ae27b",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.channel }}",
                    "rightValue": "webhook",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "webhook"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict",
                  "version": 2
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "f5810813-7704-5ea1-9810-833671086b06",
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.channel }}",
                    "rightValue": "email",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "email"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra",
          "renameFallbackOutput": "otros"
        }
      },
      "id": "0bf96838-7acf-5cf1-9e0c-dcafafd5c502",
      "name": "Por canal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        980,
        280
      ]
    },
    {
